cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the ChemE-as-Code process library, please cite it as below. The process data and
  designs are licensed under CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-DATA); the code, skills and scripts are under
  AGPL-3.0-or-later (LICENSE), and the LCI data installer (python/) is under the MIT License
  (python/LICENSE). The preferred citation is the Process Atlas paper, which is in
  preparation (2026): its title is a placeholder, and journal and DOI will be added on
  publication.
title: ChemE-as-Code process library
type: dataset
authors:
